Hello Beth<br />
&nbsp;<br />
I hope the summer is treating you and the rest of the staff well with some sell deserved down time as you prepare for the next school year.&nbsp; I have been reaching out periodically throughout the past year to see if there is a potential for a Red Cross partnership with you, the faculty, and especially with the student body.&nbsp; We are currently speaking with schools for launches of these programs for the winter/spring of next year already and would like to talk to see if your school could join as a new partner.&nbsp; I look forward to hearing from you as there are many ways we can work together and I would welcome an opportunity to speak with you about it.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
